sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Guest
    participant C as Booking chat
    participant A as LLM agent<br/>(router + ReAct)
    participant S as Scratchpad
    participant T as Tools<br/>hours · tables · bookings · deposits
    participant M as Manager
    G->>C: Ask for a table
    C->>A: Message + guest phone (from chat channel)
    Note over A: [GUARD] injection scan · card numbers stripped · message is DATA
    A->>S: write intake + flags
    Note over A,S: [SCOPE] 5 tools · refund_deposit / change_price / other guests NOT EXPOSED
    loop Until date, time and party size are known
        A->>C: Ask what is missing
        C->>G: Question
        G->>C: Details
        C->>A: Details
        Note over A: [STOPS] max 3 questions → staff call-back
    end
    A->>S: date · time · party_size
    A->>T: check_availability(date, time, party)
    Note over A,T: [RETRY] 3 tries 1-2-4 s · [BREAKER] opens after 5 fails → staff call-back
    T-->>A: free seats
    Note over A,S: [BRANCH] book_auto | large_party | no_table | ask | cancel_own | route_to_manager | unknown
    alt No table free (or outside hours)
        A->>T: check_availability (nearby slots)
        T-->>A: 2 nearest free times
    else Party is 8 or fewer
        A->>T: create_booking(idempotency_key = chat_id)
        T-->>A: booking_id
        A->>S: booking_id
    else Party is more than 8 (deposit needed)
        A->>M: Approve group booking + PHP 2,000 deposit?
        Note over A,M: [HITL GATE] money + kitchen capacity · [TIME LANE] 10 min
        alt approved
            M-->>A: approved (bound to chat + amount)
            A->>S: approval
            A->>T: charge_deposit(amount from policy, idempotency key, approval)
            T-->>A: receipt
            A->>S: deposit_charged = true (BEFORE booking)
            A->>T: create_booking(idempotency key, receipt)
            T-->>A: booking_id
            A->>S: booking_id
        else rejected
            M-->>A: rejected
            A->>T: check_availability(party = 8)
            Note over A: offer a smaller table · nothing charged
        else no answer in 10 min
            Note over A: [SAFE DEFAULT] never charge on a timeout → "staff will call you back"
        end
    end
    A->>S: final status · step count
    Note over A,S: [STOPS] 10 steps checked BEFORE every action
    A->>C: Confirmation or alternatives
    C->>G: Show reply
